<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- The Lotus mark for the Android 12+ splash screen.

     Android draws `windowSplashScreenAnimatedIcon` over the launch window on API 31+,
     and **falls back to the launcher icon when nothing is named** — which on this app
     was still the stock Flutter logo on a white squircle, sitting in the middle of the
     dark floor. Found by launching the release build on a real phone, not by reading
     the theme.

     Geometry mirrors `features/shared/lotus_mark.dart` at 0.66 scale: the outer third
     of a splash icon can be masked, so the mark is kept inside the safe zone. Stroked
     in one ink, like everywhere else — see that file for why it is never filled. -->
